@startuml UML_P3_Ranked_Elo_Update_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram 2 - Game End & Elo Update

actor "User A" as A
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB
actor "User B" as B

== Game End ==

A -> FE: Đi nước chiếu hết
FE -> API: POST /move {matchId, move}
API -> API: Validate move
API -> API: Check game end

API -> DB: SELECT rating FROM users\nWHERE id IN (A, B)
DB --> API: {A: 1500, B: 1450}

== Calculate Elo ==

note over API
  **Công thức Elo:**
  E = 1 / (1 + 10^((Rb-Ra)/400))
  ΔR = K × (S - E)
  K = 32
  
  **Ví dụ:**
  Ra=1500, Rb=1450
  Ea=0.57, Eb=0.43
  A thắng → Sa=1, Sb=0
  ΔRa = +14, ΔRb = -14
end note

== Save Results ==

API -> DB: UPDATE matches SET\nstatus='done', winnerId=A
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: UPDATE users SET\nrating=1514 WHERE id=A
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: UPDATE users SET\nrating=1436 WHERE id=B
DB --> API: OK

API -> DB: INSERT elo_history
DB --> API: OK

== Notify Players ==

API --> FE: WebSocket: game_end
FE --> A: "Thắng! +14 Elo"
FE --> B: "Thua! -14 Elo"

@enduml
